A quoted `"description"` key is a describing key, so its outline line cuts the value at 100 characters, not 40, as for the unquoted key.
== args
input/a.yaml
== file input/a.yaml
"description": A long purpose that runs past forty characters, so only a describing key keeps it whole. Then it goes on for a while longer, past the limit for describing keys.
other: A long purpose that runs past forty characters, so only a describing key keeps it whole.
== stdout
input/a.yaml (2 lines)
[L1-L1] "description": A long purpose that runs past forty characters, so only a describing key keeps it whole. Then it goe…
[L2-L2] other: A long purpose that runs past forty char…
